      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 minute between when the event happens\n  and when it is tabulated in our top-k\n\n10s of ms for to retrieve the top-k\n\nBillions of videos (TBD)\nHundreds of thousands of views per second (TBD)\n\nPrecise results (no approximation)",
